# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The workshop — design record, boards and probes. NOT part of the
# ProArc site, and it must never be committed here.
#
# This repository is PUBLIC and Pages-serves the branch root with a
# .nojekyll present, so the underscore prefix buys nothing: anything
# committed under _bmad/ is browsable on github.com AND fetchable at
# https://pixelbrahma-creator.github.io/proarc-r2/_bmad/… — which
# would publish the ProArc letter, the Opportunity Register, every
# session prompt and 23M of ProArc's own project photography.
#
# _bmad/ is backed up in its own PRIVATE repo instead, nested inside
# the excluded directory: pixelbrahma-creator/proarc-r2-wds.
#
# These four also sit in .git/info/exclude, which is where they used
# to live alone. That file is per-clone and untracked, so the guard
# did not survive a fresh clone — one `git add -A` after re-cloning
# and the workshop would have published itself. Both copies stay.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_bmad/
_bmad-output/
.claude/
_wds/
